-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy">The Study Instance UID of the imaging study that is the focus of the imaging manifest, represented as an Identifier with a fixed system and a value that corresponds to the Study Instance UID.</td></tr>
