--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy">The Accession Number of the imaging study that is the focus of the imaging manifest, represented as an Identifier with a fixed system and a value that corresponds to the Accession Number.</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="5" class="hierarchy"><br/><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Legend for this format"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="doco" style="background-color: inherit"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table></div>
